hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2793","Narrated to us Ahmad ibn Abi Suraij al-Razi, that 'Amr ibn Mujammi' informed them, on the authority of Musa ibn 'Uqba, on the authority of Nafi', on the authority of Ibn 'Umar (RA), who said:\n\The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ)"","" the day before the Day of Tarwiyah (8th of Dhu al-Hijjah)"","" would deliver a sermon to the people and inform them of the rites of Hajj.\""\n\n**CHAPTER:**"""""
